Data
- Items are read at run time from public sources, logged out: arXiv, the GitHub API, the Hugging Face Hub API,
  PyPI, Zenodo, Crossref and the Vesuvius Challenge blog feed. Titles, summaries and links belong to their sources
  and authors; the Space shows short excerpts with links back.
- The meaning scores use the embedding model BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (MIT license), run on CPU with fastembed
  (Apache 2.0).
